>go to inside

Inside Building
You are inside a building, a well house for a large spring.

There is tasty food here.

There is an empty bottle here.

>off
You switch the brass lantern off.

>drop all but lamp
treasure chest: Safely deposited.
diamonds: Safely deposited.
rare coins: Safely deposited.
bars of silver: Safely deposited.
precious jewelry: Safely deposited.
large gold nugget: Safely deposited.

[The score has just gone up by thirty-two points.]

>take food and bottle
tasty food: Taken.
small bottle: Taken.

>fill bottle
The bottle is now full of water.

>on
You switch the brass lantern on.

>go to mountain king

Hall of the Mountain King
You are in the hall of the mountain king, with passages off in all directions.

A cheerful little bird is sitting here singing.

You can also see a set of keys and a wicker cage (which is empty) here.

>take keys
Taken.

>sw

Secret E/W Canyon Above Tight Canyon
You are in a secret canyon which here runs E/W. It crosses over a very tight canyon 15 feet below. If you go down you may not be able to get back up.

>w

Secret Canyon
You are in a secret canyon which exits to the north and east.

A huge green fierce dragon bars the way!
The dragon is sprawled out on the Persian rug!

>attack dragon
With what? Your bare hands?

>yes
Congratulations! You have just vanquished a dragon with your bare hands! (Unbelievable, isn't it?)

>take rug
Taken!

[The score has just gone up by seven points.]

>n

Secret N/S Canyon
You are in a secret N/S canyon above a large room.

>d

Slab Room
You are in a large low circular chamber whose floor is an immense slab fallen from the ceiling (slab room). East and west there once were large passages, but they are now filled with boulders. Low small passages go north and south, and the south one quickly bends west around the boulders.

>s

At West End of Twopit Room
You are at the west end of the twopit room. There is a large hole in the wall above the pit at this end of the room.

>d

In West Pit
You are at the bottom of the western pit in the twopit room. There is a large hole in the wall about 25 feet above you.
There is a tiny little plant in the pit, murmuring "Water, water, ..."

>water plant
The plant spurts into furious growth for a few seconds.

There is a 12-foot-tall beanstalk stretching up out of the pit, bellowing "Water!! Water!!"

>go to inside

Inside Building
You are inside a building, a well house for a large spring.

You can see a large gold nugget, some precious jewelry, some bars of silver, many rare coins, some diamonds and a treasure chest here.

>fill bottle
The bottle is now full of water.

